peratorname{cos}⁡(x-{315}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{315}^{∘}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{315}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-332516/field-1" "q-332516/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c6a58962-cb06-519a-8c64-0dfa3b9c14d7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-332516"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-141381/selection/6758eada5f5af88abd13c4aad6b76b3afce37cf890037c3fd8776986fba83eee" :answer/id #uuid "bb0cd2d5-cda8-505f-b806-6ad9951f145b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141381/selection/c843592faadf2d42b42dd58ccc28f8a0ffce9bf51591b76fed91e91714507a58" :answer/id #uuid "51690a25-3f40-5bd1-bbb9-b60e21ebc510" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141381/selection/dbbeeaf36f4a2402a1b3dd50938bdb472990970792a7d2a0578fadbdc2fb4873" :answer/id #uuid "54ad9bd9-cbdc-585c-943c-e7e7169b2628" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141381/selection/f0c2bd5d925ee1ef1b7ee0eb315286445d2b385b93bddea08ad1fcbcfc7ebc22" :answer/id #uuid "d80310c8-8911-5612-851c-8b8f568cb343" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141381/selection/4b098d8883ebf2ba53c3601846fe278f4795f8ac00c0d681adaeae0c20d765d8" :answer/id #uuid "5eed8df1-8720-5f2d-b940-647809fc6bc2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141381/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0a0257ef-1450-5751-bb66-67b92021d549" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-141381/selection/6758eada5f5af88abd13c4aad6b76b3afce37cf890037c3fd8776986fba83eee" :answer-field/choices ["q-141381/selection/6758eada5f5af88abd13c4aad6b76b3afce37cf890037c3fd8776986fba83eee" "q-141381/selection/c843592faadf2d42b42dd58ccc28f8a0ffce9bf51591b76fed91e91714507a58" "q-141381/selection/dbbeeaf36f4a2402a1b3dd50938bdb472990970792a7d2a0578fadbdc2fb4873" "q-141381/selection/f0c2bd5d925ee1ef1b7ee0eb315286445d2b385b93bddea08ad1fcbcfc7ebc22" "q-141381/selection/4b098d8883ebf2ba53c3601846fe278f4795f8ac00c0d681adaeae0c20d765d8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-141381" :question/id #uuid "04854523-8767-5a26-82dc-08686086cd8a" :question/math-academy-id "q-141381" :question/problem "$\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{3\\pi }{4})=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the sum formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u+v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v-\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{3\\pi }{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+\\frac{3\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x)}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-141381/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "831f9aa0-099e-5e0c-8a9d-c4828b629f64"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-141381"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-119485/selection/719ad7a454c7e403c2809f55c2edcb54505c1f27a3c3cb2555d88fe770a683c7" :answer/id #uuid "1ec7c404-f956-5b56-b9a5-4a5d92151879" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡w+\\operatorname{cos}⁡w)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119485/selection/c2f129a37e63d7aec36f361fffb7e6fa808a358c3b71540a2a3a40c0237d3e35" :answer/id #uuid "3f482ba8-9fe9-5bc9-9ba3-9ea9e7daa9c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡w-\\operatorname{sin}⁡w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119485/selection/8788cc7e642a9aac2b2a0f580ab6b99a78157a74068f61fb27a1e3b9dcda6525" :answer/id #uuid "3d978735-5701-51d3-88bc-88a18cd92ace" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡w-\\operatorname{cos}⁡w)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119485/selection/15cc074774183dcad707e2c0d6592d974b19d06cfcc2d008aadcdd5e794ae9a7" :answer/id #uuid "959e76cc-0ba4-5431-b4ed-155c26865f39" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡w-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡w)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119485/selection/bb4cb9aed8c4912e096985613a9d9a0029524ea2037e133be0efacca8ead3682" :answer/id #uuid "59b571c6-a71a-594f-9a98-9bf8344f9cff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡w-\\operatorname{cos}⁡w)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-119485/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2d798f1f-a88d-58b5-a519-607f948fe6c0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-119485/selection/bb4cb9aed8c4912e096985613a9d9a0029524ea2037e133be0efacca8ead3682" :answer-field/choices ["q-119485/selection/719ad7a454c7e403c2809f55c2edcb54505c1f27a3c3cb2555d88fe770a683c7" "q-119485/selection/c2f129a37e63d7aec36f361fffb7e6fa808a358c3b71540a2a3a40c0237d3e35" "q-119485/selection/8788cc7e642a9aac2b2a0f580ab6b99a78157a74068f61fb27a1e3b9dcda6525" "q-119485/selection/15cc074774183dcad707e2c0d6592d974b19d06cfcc2d008aadcdd5e794ae9a7" "q-119485/selection/bb4cb9aed8c4912e096985613a9d9a0029524ea2037e133be0efacca8ead3682"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-119485" :question/id #uuid "92d4f2cb-5b8a-5636-96e9-9d32e4ef6033" :question/math-academy-id "q-119485" :question/problem "$\\operatorname{cos}⁡(w-\\frac{3\\pi }{4})=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=w$ and $v=\\frac{3\\pi }{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(w-\\frac{3\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡w\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡w\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡w\\cdot (-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡w\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡w-\\operatorname{cos}⁡w).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-119485/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "831f9aa0-099e-5e0c-8a9d-c4828b629f64"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-119485"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-141386/selection/89cd8d0fa26ea597d17c64a8530d2912e4843f5af8f927753ed148c96aca1e78" :answer/id #uuid "a0fbc445-eb40-565c-a62f-97f894572ff9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141386/selection/d6729d6d0e3a106d74c73a412c64bf3e5b32df3d7526e2856a844096853b971f" :answer/id #uuid "a1bc5dfd-3e9d-5944-9a46-f02199239f26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqr