torname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{\\pi }{3},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{3}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-141386/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "831f9aa0-099e-5e0c-8a9d-c4828b629f64"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-141386"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-332524/field-1/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" :answer/id #uuid "43746484-8a35-5599-8e19-c6bd957bede2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332524/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "ae9b317f-19a9-5ffe-8b27-545b68b5a3b0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-332524/field-1/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec" :answer-field/choices ["q-332524/field-1/4bd87ad5cdff0b2d0aa7574d5c7450ac33fa34774f895ce16d251ca09a1932ec"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-332524/field-2/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer/id #uuid "730d07cf-efe4-5569-9109-e43da87a8c8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332524/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "5ce125d4-6435-5327-ab1b-97eba3e444b3" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-332524/field-2/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9" :answer-field/choices ["q-332524/field-2/e014eef6d5b5b99f76a63badf4d7e4589d1524a951e6f15c41809dcf478e3da9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-332524" :question/id #uuid "89559e51-6a02-56cd-bbee-deaf6d525283" :question/math-academy-id "q-332524" :question/problem "Express $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-\\frac{5\\pi }{4})$ in terms of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n$\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-\\frac{5\\pi }{4})=$\n{{field-1}}$\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,-$\n{{field-2}}$\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for cosine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{5\\pi }{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x-\\frac{5\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-332524/field-1" "q-332524/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "831f9aa0-099e-5e0c-8a9d-c4828b629f64"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-332524"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-332526/field-1/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "8be22942-4834-5d69-9c9d-ff1f6efbb68d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332526/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0496349-b562-5177-83d7-3f1c1e5ab48b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :ans